        "id": "Text-dffdb41f-aa0c-433e-b5f1-8ac544f931b7",
        "text": "<p>This project was done with \"This and That\", the Ahmedabad based design studio. The brief of the project was to develop a bed collection which complements their then latest furniture collection- The Bastar collection. This Project was done in collaboration with the Tangaliya weavers of Gujarat.</p>",
